# UI-INFO-2: the info panel's rotate arrows at 1024 x 768. The construction menu's public cell
# (0, 0) arms the pioneer house 501 and opens its info panel; each left click on rotate_left
# (hud.txt click centre 824 470) turns the rotation -1, each on rotate_right (1003 470) +1, as the
# original's View.dll 0x10030440 / 0x10030480 do (GOG Wine-runner shots u2_501_L1..L4, R1..R4:
# blocks 3, 2, 1, 0 and 1, 2, 3, 0). `ui.info.rotation` is the rotation the preview shows,
# `tool.turn` the turn the map ghost is drawn and a click builds at (the same for this plain type),
# and the title the developer tool's own line. Key T turns the same rotation (+1). The house is
# then built at rotation 2 on the tile construction_menu_arm.script proves free for it.
# Launch: --play data/maps/lan5.txt --construction-menu on --layout data/ui
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
key b
wait frames 5
click_px 833 330
wait frames 5
expect title build 501
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 0
expect fact tool.turn == 0
click_px 824 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 3
expect fact tool.turn == 3
expect title rotation 3
click_px 824 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 2
click_px 824 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 1
click_px 824 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 0
expect fact tool.turn == 0
click_px 1003 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 1
expect fact tool.turn == 1
expect title rotation 1
click_px 1003 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 2
click_px 1003 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 3
click_px 1003 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 0
# One rotation for keys and arrows: T (+1), then the left arrow (-1), then T, T.
key t
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 1
click_px 824 470
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 0
key t
wait frames 3
key t
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 2
expect fact tool.turn == 2
expect title rotation 2
# The arrows sit on the panel: clicking them never reaches the map (no command, no selection).
expect fact selection.clicks == 0
click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
expect fact ui.info.rotation == 2
quit
